{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>英國足球傳奇碧咸（David Beckham）與時尚設計師維多利亞（Victoria Beckham）14歲小女兒哈七（Harper Beckham）近期因頻繁缺課、長期跟隨父母出席</p><p>根據外媒報導，哈七目前就讀的學校年學費高達2.8萬英鎊（約30萬港元），2026年復活節假期結束後，並未如期返回倫敦就讀的私立學校，反而頻繁現身紐約、巴黎等地，陪同母親出席品牌發表會、香水宣傳及時裝周活動。類似情況並非首次。2025年1月，哈七便曾於上課期間飛往巴黎觀看時裝秀，當時就已引發部分網友質疑。如今再度缺課陪同父母工作，也讓輿論進一步發酵。</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260514/1131532970092400640071546.jpeg/3vgryWObvXQO_1tPdiBHrMyNVDyrde2yEBDPtxAQz7c\" alt=\"哈七與碧咸、維多利亞的合照（Instagram@harperbeckhamdaily2）\"><figcaption>哈七與碧咸、維多利亞的合照（Instagram@harperbeckhamdaily2）</figcaption></figure><p>更多哈七Harper Beckham的相片：</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260514/1131533737520009216872163.jpeg/FswpyfsjA1XIK1Hf2or0kpsxxDpvV22gkMCi-pDAovo\" alt=\"哈七（Instagram@harperbeckhamdaily2）\"><figcaption>哈七（Instagram@harperbeckhamdaily2）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260514/1131533739856367616562391.jpeg/XHri5B11yKL32Z0oqtUQMOG5LACPzNGxKgz4ySoM-Mk\" alt=\"哈七（Instagram@harperbeckhamdaily2）\"><figcaption>哈七（Instagram@harperbeckhamdaily2）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260514/1131533742083674112720956.jpeg/b2YCxAH11KjDDK6yIBOhF7ofs2mRrCkU8N1BDPDdQQw\" alt=\"哈七（Instagram@harperbeckhamdaily2）\"><figcaption>哈七（Instagram@harperbeckhamdaily2）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260514/1131533744457781248913402.jpeg/cgMF5R36noqm_3qS0QTaHGaZ_BE9Kz8XlMxG5JTMRuQ\" alt=\"哈七（Instagram@harperbeckhamdaily2）\"><figcaption>哈七（Instagram@harperbeckhamdaily2）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260514/1131533746336960512610492.jpeg/xEEAZQEKAtW_Z2g2PPRz7ZCAMCXT9u0E9RH5sfUR-bE\" alt=\"哈七（Instagram@harperbeckhamdaily2）\"><figcaption>哈七（Instagram@harperbeckhamdaily2）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260514/1131533737700364288519467.jpeg/egeVWNorbIMgm6GIogmtladHpdqyo43g6yk5c-spOXM\" alt=\"哈七（Instagram@harperbeckhamdaily2）\"><figcaption>哈七（Instagram@harperbeckhamdaily2）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260514/1131533739965419520730624.jpeg/i1glA4kLpKcADm1KxgDV4chGCw_HUyFtQK8800CvPNM\" alt=\"哈七（Instagram@harperbeckhamdaily2）\"><figcaption>哈七（Instagram@harperbeckhamdaily2）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260514/1131533742339526656523947.jpeg/sdRWrbjY1NUyti76SXQf21slVRuKPRbmka7kGpGu5Bo\" alt=\"哈七（Instagram@harperbeckhamdaily2）\"><figcaption>哈七（Instagram@harperbeckhamdaily2）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260514/1131533744558444544031594.jpeg/7YEIxKjAChmuNtesf49jKGGd1AYxoHKxd4v0Y3eL9GM\" alt=\"哈七（Instagram@harperbeckhamdaily2）\"><figcaption>哈七（Instagram@harperbeckhamdaily2）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260514/1131533746777362432639715.jpeg/nLYvkAHEZEBXPF8Of0hgHzyEHa-dwRogq-RxsavkcbE\" alt=\"哈七（Instagram@harperbeckhamdaily2）\"><figcaption>哈七（Instagram@harperbeckhamdaily2）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260514/1131533737444511744203497.jpeg/j9L7CHAE9CUdoBGuyhk9472YFSRzOsHKqcbTNanG0zU\" alt=\"哈七（Instagram@harperbeckhamdaily2）\"><figcaption>哈七（Instagram@harperbeckhamdaily2）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260514/1131533739827007488431807.jpeg/p9h09JxxXx3nRDvO4P9cVT4oYecSt-wad_YePHf2Hjw\" alt=\"哈七（Instagram@harperbeckhamdaily2）\"><figcaption>哈七（Instagram@harperbeckhamdaily2）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260514/1131533742138200064527641.jpeg/pgTwcde3qgHVeeYfO_QHkoZ-IHZsJID8SAmuK0gJris\" alt=\"哈七（Instagram@harperbeckhamdaily2）\"><figcaption>哈七（Instagram@harperbeckhamdaily2）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260514/1131533744310980608031254.jpeg/_sUctTzTfnuFQFgurv23bkabbYEvTrCXqtJNxqrSTcY\" alt=\"哈七（Instagram@harperbeckhamdaily2）\"><figcaption>哈七（Instagram@harperbeckhamdaily2）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260514/1131533746416652288432798.jpeg/_WKX0Mx-sLwD7J_R2Jf__dBqQ3KOIrqk1_OyLdfzsi0\" alt=\"哈七（Instagram@harperbeckhamdaily2）\"><figcaption>哈七（Instagram@harperbeckhamdaily2）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260514/1131533735133450240908257.jpeg/torsVW6VdH-JtuHAWe1zeT3m_TNbfxdX-vcLEfr3CxE\" alt=\"哈七（Instagram@harperbeckhamdaily2）\"><figcaption>哈七（Instagram@harperbeckhamdaily2）</figcaption></figure><p>不少網友認為，14歲正值建立校園社交與學習基礎的重要階段，長期暴露在商業與媒體環境中，恐怕影響正常成長。有評論直言：</p><p>外界之所以對此特別敏感，也與碧咸家族近期的家庭風波有關。年初，碧咸長子布魯克林（Brooklyn Beckham）曾發長文控訴父母「把品牌放在親情之上」，甚至指家人間的關係需要透過社群媒體互動與公開讚美來維繫，並批評父母「用謊言維持完美形象」。相關言論曝光後，也讓外界重新檢視頻繁參與商業活動的背後原因。</p><p>據爆料，現年已超過50歲的碧咸夫婦，正積極布局「碧咸2.0時代」。除了持續經營家族品牌外，哈七也被傳將於今年推出個人美妝品牌「HIKU」，主打韓系彩妝與年輕市場，顯示家族有意提前為她鋪路，進一步擴大商業版圖。</p><p>延伸閱讀：碧咸大仔布魯克林長文控訴父母：生日拒見新抱、婚禮前逼簽棄權書</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260120/1090225070556581888513794.jpeg/hYsrHwI7gw2Yrc9FqLJG-MltbNgpGxyUySrbTskq204\" alt=\"【延伸閱讀：碧咸大仔布魯克林長文控訴父母：生日拒見新抱、婚禮前逼簽棄權書】碧咸大仔布魯克林Brooklyn Beckham發公開聲明與父母決裂（Instagram@brooklynpeltzbeckham）\"><figcaption>【延伸閱讀：碧咸大仔布魯克林長文控訴父母：生日拒見新抱、婚禮前逼簽棄權書】碧咸大仔布魯克林Brooklyn Beckham發公開聲明與父母決裂（Instagram@brooklynpeltzbeckham）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260120/1090225072804859904589320.jpeg/tIPZWXp4H4Ru7X57aTf7uPyzMWmY3_sIq0ExwKtBMcA\" alt=\"碧咸大仔布魯克林Brooklyn Beckham發公開聲明與父母決裂（Instagram@brooklynpeltzbeckham）\"><figcaption>碧咸大仔布魯克林Brooklyn Beckham發公開聲明與父母決裂（Instagram@brooklynpeltzbeckham）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260120/1090225075040555008649102.jpeg/MdKlvORdXnUOrVNihzz4Z9VmFMKnmFh7XCRulFwkbpQ\" alt=\"碧咸大仔布魯克林Brooklyn Beckham發公開聲明與父母決裂（Instagram@brooklynpeltzbeckham）\"><fig